    "subject": "pediatrics",
    "originalNumber": 78,
    "stem": "A 5 month old infant in a daycare facility develops\nlow grade fever, rhonorrhea and cough. A few days\nlater, she is brought to the ER with tachypnea, chest\nretractions, diffuse expiratory whezing and fine\ninspiratory rales bilateraly. Which of the ff is\ncorrect regarding his diagnosis?",
