    "subject": "pediatrics",
    "originalNumber": 92,
    "stem": "12. After 2 days, KEC was discharged. Nurse JoAnne\nwho is also a neighbor of KEC came to visit her to\ncheck on her blood pressure at home but was also\nexposed to KEC’s 2 year old child. Which of the\nfollowing is not true regarding prevention of VZV\ntransmission?",
