    "explanation": "in severe hemophilia, PTT value is usually 2 - 3 times\nthe upper limit of normal. REsults of other screening\ntests (platelet count, bleeding time, PT, thrombin\ntime) are normal.\nNelson’s Textbook of Pediatrics 19th edition",
