    "id": "superexam-pediatrics-0102",
    "subject": "pediatrics",
    "originalNumber": 102,
    "stem": "A 5 year old girl presenting with mental reatrdation\nassociated with fair complexion is most likely due\nto: A. Maple syrup urine\ndisease",
