    "subject": "pediatrics",
    "originalNumber": 128,
    "stem": "A 7 year-old boy arrives at the emergency\ndepartment due to hematuria and scanty urine\noutput for the past 24 hours. Ten days prior to\nconsult, he had fever and throat pain but did not\nseek consult. Which of the following will be the\nmost important in his diagnosis.",
