    "id": "superexam-pediatrics-0131",
    "subject": "pediatrics",
    "originalNumber": 131,
    "stem": "A 10-year-old obese female presented with\npolyuria, polydypsia, and hyperpigmentation of the\nskin of the beck arrives at your clinic for consult.\nLaboratory findings showed a high insulin level,\nnormal C peptide and FBS of 186 mg/dL. The most\nlikely diagnosis is:",
