    "explanation": "TB disease : 3 or more of the following criteria: 1.\nExposure to an adult/adolescent with active TB\ndisease; 2. (+) PPD; 3. s/sx suggestive of TB; 4. (+)\nAbnormal cxr findings; 5. Lab findings. TB infection :\n+/- exposure, (+) PPD, no s/sx, (-) cxr findings",
