    "id": "superexam-pediatrics-0141",
    "subject": "pediatrics",
    "originalNumber": 141,
    "stem": "A 2 year old child came at the ER due to convulsions\nand upon PE, you noted the child is in active\nseizure, the mother told you that the child had fever\nprior to the seizure episode, the first step you\nshould do as the ER ROD is:",
