    "explanation": "This is a case of PKU, the enzyme defective in this case\nis Phenylalanine hydroxylase causing buildup of\nphenylalanine. This causes the formation of\nphenylacetate, phenylpyruvate and phenethylamine\nwhich causes the characteristic musty body odor.",
