    "stem": "5 year old patient has arthritis of the knees, rashes\non the legs and intermittent abdominal pain for the\npast 3 days. History revealed previous upper\nrespiratory tract infection. If the patient's kidney is\ninvolved, IgA mesangial deposition.is expected to\nbe seen in kidney biopsy. What is the most probable\ndiagnosis?",
