    "stem": "A 7 day old neonate was rushed to the ER because\nthe mother noticed that the patient had difficulty\nbreathing and was unable to breastfeed. On closer\nexamination, patient was jaundiced, tachypneic\nwith subcostal retractions, crackles all over\nbilateral lung bases, difficult to arouse, cold clammy\nskin, mottled in appearance, what is the\nappropriate course of action?",
