    "stem": "Ten years after a primary measles infection, a 13-\nyear-old boy was diagnosed to have subacute\nsclerosing panencephalitis. He now exhibits\nrepetitive myoclonic jerks and involuntary\nmovements, but consciousness is maintained. He is\nnow in this stage of SSPE:",
