    "subject": "pediatrics",
    "originalNumber": 345,
    "stem": "A 7 year old male with Dengue fever developed\nupper GI bleeding. He was then noted to have\ndecreased urine output. On PE: BP 80/50 PR\n120/min with cold, clammy skin and weak pulses.\nHe was given several boluses of plasma expanders.\nThis resulted in improved urine volume. His renal\nfailure is classified as:",
