    "explanation": "To differentiate diphtheria from strep throat, the\nformer relatively presents afebrile and with the well-\ndistinguished pseudomembrane in the pharynx.\nDiphtheria is notorious for its grave complications of\ntoxic cardiomyopathy and toxic neuropathy (previous\nquestion as well!). Penicillin is the treatment of choice.",
