    "id": "superexam-pediatrics-0431",
    "subject": "pediatrics",
    "originalNumber": 431,
    "stem": "A 15-year old male sought consult in a local clinic\ncomplaining of recurrent headache. He described it\nas a band-like tightness sometimes throbbing\noccuring in the frontal region that radiates to his\nleft parietal area. There was no nausea, vomiting,\ndizziness, anorexia, photophobia, change in\nalertness or intellect. He also reported that the\ncondition seems to worsen during classes. At this\npoint, the best possible impression is:",
