    "correctChoice": "C",
    "explanation": "Ferrous sulfate is given at a dose 6 mg/kg/day\n(elemental iron). Subjective improvement is expected\nafter 12-24 hours; preliminary BM response after 48\nhours; increase in reticulocyte count after 72 hours;\nhemoglobin increase after 4-6 weeks; and repletion of\niron stores after 3 months.",
