    "id": "superexam-pediatrics-0489",
    "subject": "pediatrics",
    "originalNumber": 489,
    "stem": "One-month-old Argie is admitted to the hospital for\njaundice. Her total bilirubin is demonstrated to be\n12 mg/dL with direct bilirubin of 4.5 mg/dl. Which\namong the following is a likely diagnosis?",
