    "explanation": "SIMILAR TO PREVIOUS BOARD EXAM\nCONCEPT/PRINCIPLE. The classic description would\nusually include currant-jelly stool (not mentioned\nduring our exam) and a palpable sausage mass on the\nRUQ or RLQ.",
