    "explanation": "There are only 3 stages of TB meningitis. Stage 1: non-\nspecific signs, conscious, no hydrocephalus. Stage 2:\nconfusion and or focal neurologic signs. Stage 3:\nstupor, delirium, hemiplegia.",
