    "stem": "Rhea, a 2-year-old child, presents with infantile\nspasms, hypopigmented lesions throughout her\nback (ash-leaf spots) and a single raised lesion over\nthe sacrum (shagreen patch). Which is the most\nlikely diagnosis?",
