    "originalNumber": 497,
    "stem": "Ivy, an 8-year-old child, was brought to your clinic\nfor deep, aching pain over the lower extremities,\nmost commonly noted in the evening and gone by\nthe morning. The patient is otherwise\nasymptomatic and your PE is essentially normal.\nWhat is the best management?",
