    "subject": "pediatrics",
    "originalNumber": 498,
    "stem": "While bathing her 2 year old son, Marg feels a mass\nin the abdomen. A thourough medical evaluation\nreveals aniridia, hypospadias, horseshoe kidney\nand hemihypertrophy. Which is the most likely\ndiagnosis?",
