    "stem": "A 12/F is brought to the clinic due to fever and\npainful joints. Five days PTC, the parents noted that\npatient was febrile and has a sore and swollen left\nknee. A few days later, her left knee improved; but\nher left elbow started to become similarly sore and\nswollen. You note that the patient had a sore throat\nfour weeks prior. What is the MOST likely\ndiagnosis?",
