    "originalNumber": 559,
    "stem": "A 24/F medical student comes in due to a 10-day\nhistory of malaise, low-grade fever, headache and\nnausea. On physical examination, enlarged\nposterior cervical lymph nodes are palpated,\nhypertrophied tonsils with exudates were seen, and\nthe Traube's space was obliterated. CBC done\nrevealed leukocytosis with lymphocytic\npredominance. Which of the following organisms is\nthe most likely etiologic agent?",
