    "id": "superexam-pediatrics-0585",
    "subject": "pediatrics",
    "originalNumber": 585,
    "stem": "A 2 year old male was noted to have a right inguinal\nbulge. On physical examination, the mass is smooth,\nfirm, and more prominent on crying. Both testes\nwere palpated in the scrotum. Transillumination\nwas negative. This condition is due to?",
