    "id": "superexam-pediatrics-0626",
    "subject": "pediatrics",
    "originalNumber": 626,
    "stem": "A 3 year old boy is brought to the office by his\nparents who are concerned because he has hard,\npainful stools. For the past 4 months, their son\ndefecates evry 3-4 days and cries during stooling.\nThe resulting stool is very hard. PE of the child is\nnomal. Which of the ollowing is correct regarding\nhis constipation?",
