    "subject": "pediatrics",
    "originalNumber": 688,
    "stem": "A newborn was brought to the ER for seizures. She\nwas born at home and a sharpened bamboo stick\nwas used to cut the umbilical cord. The mother\nnever had prenatal check-up and her immunization\nstatus was unknown. Your diagnosis is Neonatal\nTetanus. The drug of choice is most likely",
